{"parentUuid":"5195cae8-1f6b-435f-a8ba-4116cf2f544a","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"hook_success","hookName":"SessionStart:startup","toolUseID":"6f7ea7b5-a2ca-4fe6-885a-06e6bf7fe357","hookEvent":"SessionStart","content":"=== REMEMBER ===\nHistory in .remember/: now.md (buffer), today-*.md (daily), recent.md (7d), archive.md (old), archive-YYYY-MM-DD*.md and recent-YYYY-MM-DD*.md (rotated slices, older still; a second rotation the same day gets a -2 suffix), core-memories.md (key moments). Search on user request — the rotated slices are NOT injected below, grep them when a question reaches past what is.\n\n=== MEMORY ===\n--- now.md ---\n\n## 02:06 | main\nMerged PR #13 (landing-page/auth fix + favicon) as 0e17c07; Vercel auto-deploy in progress.\n--- recent.md ---\n# Recent\n\n## 2026-09-01\ntrace-panel #3: fixed typing/lint + 6 traceparent hops across auth/bridge/storage/routes; OAuth error handling improved (token-missing → auth-failure-report); Iceberg analytics-panel added (S3 creds, connection state); nav UI refactored (extracted app-logo/app-sidebar); observability-mcp-logs (PR #12) & extension-landing-auth (PR #13) merged main w/ Vercel deploy ✓; SQL dashboard feat: usePing hook, dark/light/query-exec/history verified via agent QA.\n\n## 2026-08-31\nImplemented W3C traceparent correlation in supabase-devtool: cut unused executeSupabaseRPC, refactored agent-trace-bridge/api-auth/routes to mint-or-forward headers, edge fn returns traceId. Demo end-to-end verified via `bun start` with 3 correlated logs; build/lint/typecheck at baseline. agent-query deployed live on jqjaisrrpoemnrnevmvf; E2E trace verify staged awaiting local run.\n\n## Identity Candidates\n- IDENTITY CANDIDATE: Reverse-engineers and systematically merges cross-project eval harnesses; builds sophisticated token accounting across heterogeneous LLM providers w/ delta attribution\n--- archive.md ---\n# Archive\n\n## Week of 2026-08-10\nFixed page.tsx sidebar layout (flex-row beside content) and auth-failure alert w/ OAuth reconnect + demo-view buttons; merged sidebar nav refactor, resource-warnings panel, trace step duration → prod. Refactored latency-monitor/project-dashboard to semantic status colors, extracted stat-tile.tsx. Deployed auth fix + restyle (2 commits, 18 files, -207 LOC). Fixed 13 Dependabot vulns (sharp 0.34.5→0.35.3 + transitive deps).\n\n## Week of 2026-08-04\nAdded resource-warnings panel w/ Supabase Mgmt API integration; restructured top bar into collapsible left sidebar (Inspect/Run/Observe/Manage groups); restored warnings tab; added mobile select fallback; diagnosed PostHog ad-blocker issue.\n\n## Week of 2026-07-27\nMerged AgentPrism trace-viewer + trigger-suite eval testing into supabase/evals via 4-phase plan; ported 43 UI comps + 97 skill-activation evals; built token accounting across 4 LLM providers (Claude Code/ai-sdk/OpenRouter/Codex) w/ per-span delta attribution. Fixed trace-viewer timeline bar collapse (epoch 1970, 56yr skew); redesigned TraceListItem cards. Ran 135-eval suite on openai-gpt-5.6 (43/135 pass).\n\n## Week of 2026-07-08\nVerified OAuth fallback in supabase-devtool; added extension_unavailable error code w/ inline OAuth CTA.\n\n## Week of 2026-06-30\nBuilt supabase-triage skill w/ 9 category refs + 259 GitHub discussions index. Iterated logs panel backends (ClickHouse → BigQuery → Supabase MCP); replaced ext proxy bridge w/ session-only cred injection.\n\n## Week of 2026-06-23\nSecurity review of supabase-devtool. Migrated DCR creds/agent config to sessionStorage; hardened ext-bridge postMessage vault, service-role-key risk AlertDialog, AbortError retry-with-backoff.\n\n## Week of 2026-06-21\nShipped zero-trust cred storage for subasehire.me (ext vault bridge, sessionStorage, SSRF guard, GH #9); full SEO stack w/ security review. Fixed Dependabot alerts, zero leaked-key matches.\n\n## Week of 2026-06-13\nFixed realtime-trace pipeline (dedup, spans, durations); hardened AI SQL fns w/ prompt-injection fix; built self-deploying ai-sql dbdev ext. Built PostHog analytics + server-side OTel/OpenAI observability; deployed prod.\n\n## Week of 2026-06-09\nRestored SupaAgentPanel; eliminated ~1300 React key warnings + listener leaks; rewrote api/sql to MCP execute_sql w/ OAuth fallbacks; fixed token refresh (Zustand), 500→401 schema/RLS errors. Fixed hydration issues (CLS 0.127→0.004).\n\n## Week of 2026-06-05\nShipped AI inference system (OpenAI/Supabase toggle) + explainQuery agent; migrated creds to headers across 16 routes. Built Supabase Edge Functions VS Code debug ext (v0.1.0); deployed prod w/ security review.\n\n## Week of 2026-06-02\nShipped supabasehire.me w/ AgentPrism traces + OTLP edge fn; fixed Tailwind @theme tokens and dark mode; --brand-supabase token across 26 comps.\n\n## Week of 2026-05-26\nAgentPrism OTLP integration w/ trace-panel deployment (42 UI comps); dark mode theme.css bridging.\n\n## Week of 2026-05-25\nAssessed Iceberg load; added Benchmark tab w/ S3/localStorage persistence; fixed SSRF + unauth key vulns; fixed prod agent auth, RLS 500.\n\n## Week of 2026-05-18\n6-session agent-loop QA; Evil Martians design (OKLCH tokens, dark mode). Storage tab w/ DuckDB WASM Parquet viewer; dagre auto-layout for schema diagrams. Reconstructed OMOP CDM; backfilled 117k+ person.location_id and 3.6M+ visit FKs.\n\n=== MEMORY CONSOLIDATION ===\n1 day(s) of memory to compress. Running consolidation in background...","stdout":"=== REMEMBER ===\nHistory in .remember/: now.md (buffer), today-*.md (daily), recent.md (7d), archive.md (old), archive-YYYY-MM-DD*.md and recent-YYYY-MM-DD*.md (rotated slices, older still; a second rotation the same day gets a -2 suffix), core-memories.md (key moments). Search on user request — the rotated slices are NOT injected below, grep them when a question reaches past what is.\n\n=== MEMORY ===\n--- now.md ---\n\n## 02:06 | main\nMerged PR #13 (landing-page/auth fix + favicon) as 0e17c07; Vercel auto-deploy in progress.\n--- rece