{"parentUuid":"ceeb1dc4-b750-4572-a972-8886251b94e7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CesLNnVqz6FNFgVLK7eXz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_017MAyirnc8nHUQHx6WGwVxi","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nfix(sql,traces): surface real causes behind the failures in the Jam recording\n\nEvery AI demo failed with a raw MCP JSON blob, and the Agent Traces pane sat on\n\"No trace yet\" while the token mint was blocked by CORS.\n\n- Unwrap the MCP `{\"error\":{\"message\":...}}` envelope at the single callTool\n  throw site, so every route shows the bare Postgres error instead of JSON.\n- Add an install hint when a query hits a missing `ai_*` function — those come\n  from the supa_aisql extension, which is not on a stock project.\n- Two demos called `public.ai_summary()`, which supa_aisql does not ship. Both\n  now use `ai_complete(..., system_text => ...)`, which drops the `pInline`\n  positional-provider hack.\n- Keep the toast to the error's first line; LINE/HINT detail stays in the panel.\n- An unknown edge-function slug 404s the preflight without CORS headers, so the\n  mint fetch rejects before any status is read. Catch it and report \"not\n  installed\", and render the pairing error in the empty trace state.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/REDACTED\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":261,"cache_read_input_tokens":171733,"output_tokens":481,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":261,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":481,"cache_read_input_tokens":171733,"cache_creation_input_to